    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "I have actually already tweaked the current implementation of reductions to support this on a branch of mine with join-related primitives  (since I needed to count non-zero values with a cudf function, into a `gdf_size_type`). I only touched the existing code very slightly, but enough to expose different-type aggregations above. Of course, considering the fact that our reduction code has at least one other major undesirable feature (two phases), perhaps a larger refactoring is relevant.",
